    "detailed_description": "All power begins with a little bit of knowledge.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpellsword is an interactive web-based game designed to improve our command of the English language. Embark on a quest and conquer rivals! With over 15 customized avatars to choose from, you can immerse yourself in a futuristic world of magic and learning. Compete with other players in real-time and climb the ranks!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpellsword is played in 1v1 matches between another user in real-time. From a given set of randomly generated letters, take turns trying to guess words from those given set of letters. The more complex the word, the more points you'll get! The user that's first to hit 30 points wins!",
